# Q Amp and the gear room split a heavy rig across worker threads through a SharedArrayBuffer (src/amp/ring.ts),
# which a browser only hands to a cross-origin isolated page. `bun run dev` sends the same (vite.config.ts).
/amp
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
/amp.html
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
/studio
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
/studio.html
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
